cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the model, please cite it as below."
title: "JapaneseTinyAgentLM: tiny Japanese language models that run on an ESP32-S3"
abstract: >-
  A 3.15M-parameter Japanese Action language model, trained from scratch, that maps short
  Japanese requests to robot action calls (JSON) and runs entirely on an ESP32-S3
  (M5Stack Stack-chan, CoreS3) in INT4 with grammar-constrained decoding and a confidence gate.
authors:
  - name: ayutaz
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ayutaz/JapaneseTinyAgentLM"
url: "https://huggingface.co/ayousanz/JapaneseTinyAgentLM-Action-3M"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-01"
keywords:
  - japanese
  - tiny language model
  - function calling
  - esp32
  - microcontroller
  - robotics
  - stack-chan
